        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Piano Sonata No. 8 (Prokofiev)\n- People: Emil Gilels\n- Places: Moscow\n- Topics: First performances, Soviet pianists\n\nFacts:\n- Emil Gilels was born on 19 October 1916 and became a Soviet pianist.\n- Emil Gilels was widely regarded as one of the greatest pianists of the 20th century.\n- Piano Sonata No. 8 by Sergei Prokofiev was first performed on 30 December 1944 in Moscow by Emil Gilels.\n- Emil Gilels died on 14 October 1985.",
